{"id":"n62755-1-10","stage":4,"title":"샘 · 泉","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62755-1-10-1","ko":"어제 동생과 샘에 발을 담그고 놀았어.","zh":"昨天和家里小的那个把脚泡在泉水里玩。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"동생과","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생과","audio":"/audio/defbd4bcda08b09b62c5.mp3"}},{"text":"샘에","meaning":"泉，泉水","explanation":"샘：泉，泉水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"샘","audio":"/audio/893d92264a469f674996.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62755","senseId":"1","lemma":"샘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샘에","audio":"/audio/575f95c6b795d010bcbb.mp3"}},{"text":"발을","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발을","audio":"/audio/bce84895e74d38be0e63.mp3"}},{"text":"담그고","meaning":"浸泡","explanation":"담그다：浸泡；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"담그다","audio":"/audio/ead53307477459fb156d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62832","senseId":"1","lemma":"담그다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담그고","audio":"/audio/68e6f699b23e4e2882dd.mp3"}},{"text":"놀았어.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":