nation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았겠구나","audio":"/audio/d2da7cd61cc83ff5db29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/181266e0438f373fc257.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.453,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62755","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨天和家里小的那个把脚泡在泉水里玩。","一定很凉快很舒服吧。","这个房间不会有点窄吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天和家里小的那个把脚泡在泉水里玩。","一定很凉快很舒服吧。","这个房间不会有点窄吧？"],"answer":1}]}
